   "source": [
    "## 2. Business Understanding\n",
    "\n",
    "Fraud is **rare but costly**. We must catch fraud (high recall) without flooding analysts with false alarms (reasonable precision). Accuracy is a *trap* here — see below."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "a7925e30",
   "metadata": {
